    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "f6737feb4bf247df920f2c97db3ceaf1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1828,
    "chunk_text": "Procurement of Essential Medical Supplies from the State Pharmaceuticals Manufacturing Corporation and Local Manufactures\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-12-02 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- Approval has been granted at the Cabinet meeting held on 2024-10-14 to purchase locally manufactured medicines and medical supplies from the identified local manufacturers for an ensuing period of one year. Accordingly, the Ministry of Health and Mass Media has prepared 04 lists of pharmaceuticals that could be provided by local manufactures who have signed Joint Venture Agreements with the State Pharmaceuticals Manufacturing Corporation, the local manufacturers who have signed Buy Back Agreements with the Ministry of Health and those who have not entered into agreements as of now. As such, the Cabinet approved the proposal made by the Minister of Health and Mass Media to award the following procurements, based on the recommendations submitted by the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee, having examined the said 04 lists.\n\n*\tTo award the procurement for the supply of 42 pharmaceutical items to the State Pharmaceuticals Manufacturing Corporation, for a sum of Rs. 5,398.83 million.\n*\tTo award  the procurement for the supply of 131 pharmaceutical items to the local manufacturers who have signed Joint Venture Agreements with the State Pharmaceuticals Manufacturing Corporation, for a sum of Rs. 16,611.42 million. \n*\tTo award  the procurement for the supply of 36 pharmaceutical items to the local manufacturers who have signed Buy Back Agreements with the Ministry of Health and Mass Media, for a sum of Rs. 9,022.10 million. \n*\tTo award the procurement for the supply of 130 pharmaceutical items to 24 newly selected local manufacturers, for a sum of Rs. 13,374.65 million."
